# MediChain-AI Frontend Environment Variables
# In production on Vercel, set this in your Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables
# Example: https://medichain-backend.onrender.com/api/v1
# In local development, leave unset or default to /api/v1 (proxied by Vite to http://127.0.0.1:4000)
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
